    "text": "<p>The given plots represent the variation of the concentration of a reactant <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi></math> with time for two different reactions <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>and</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>(</mo><mi>ii</mi><mo>)</mo></math>. The respective orders of the reaction are<br />(i)&nbsp;<img src=\"assets\\qt0151_19956917385f.png\" style=\"width: 273px; height: 203px;\" /></p><p>(ii)&nbsp;<img src=\"assets\\qt0151_a9dfac55d0c5.png\" style=\"width: 267px; height: 206px;\" /></p>"
