  "solution": {
    "text": "<p><img src=\"assets\\st0151_8b54b5f8d148.png\" style=\"width: 274px; height: 205px;\" /><br />First-order <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi><mo>&#10230;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi></math> differential rate law<br /><math><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi></mrow></mfenced></math> ;</p><p><math><mtext>ln</mtext><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">ln</mi></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow></msub></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mrow><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi></math><br /><img src=\"assets\\st0151_25a4bf8136bd.png\" style=\"width: 267px; height: 209px;\" /><br />Zero-order time.<br /><math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi><mo>&#10230;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi></math></p><p>Differential rate law,&nbsp;<math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mo>[</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi><mo>]</mo><mo>/</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>[</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi><mo>]</mo><mo>=</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi><mo>&#8728;</mo></msub><mo>-</mo><mi>Kt</mi></math></p>"
